ated_at":"2026-09-12T16:30:31Z","closed_at":"2026-09-12T16:30:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Consistently reproducible in v4.8.dev5.official [9552dfb68]\n-Was not an issue in previous dev4 release.\n-Possibly specific to macOS Metal renderer.\n\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 26.6.2, Mac Studio 2022 M1 Ultra, 64GB, 3 monitor setup.\n\n### Issue description\n\n4.8-dev5 launches into the project selector window fine, but consistently crashes when trying to open an existing project or create a new one.  According to crash logs, the faulting instruction is:\n\n> OffsetAllocator::Allocator::free(OffsetAllocator::Allocation)\n\nCPU exception:\n\n> EXC_BAD_ACCESS\n> SIGBUS\n> KERN_PROTECTION_FAILURE\n\nLooks like it's trying to access an address on the Metal heap.\n\nLaunching this version of Godot from Terminal using rendering method gl_compatibility seems to work OK.  This issue did not exist on 4.8-dev4.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch Godot 4.8-dev5\n2. Click +Create button.\n3. Choose target folder and click Create button.\n4. Crash\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations